      "topic": "genitive",
      "heading": "Genetiivi n — Kenen? Minkä?",
      "text": "The genitive ending is -n; it shows possession. Adjective and noun both take -n (kivan opettajan nimi). Consonant-stem names add -in (Alex → Alexin). Strong/weak gradation applies: Helsinki → Helsingin (nk → ng).",
